WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.633
Sharing equally

2
00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:11.500
Mama wants to share twelve oranges equally among three children. Nobody should get more than anyone else.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.133
One for you, one for you, one for him: we share in turns.

4
00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:20.333
We keep going until they are all gone.

5
00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:23.900
Each child gets four oranges.

6
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.867
Twelve divided by three equals four.
